          "explanation": "<p>Nine persons: J, K, L, M, N, O, P, Q, R</p>\n\n<p>Faces both directions North and South.</p>\n\n<p>1) J sits 4<sup>th</sup> from one of the extreme ends.</p>\n\n<p>2) K sits 5<sup>th</sup> to the right of J.</p>\n\n<p>3) Two persons sit between K and N and both K and N are facing towards the north.</p>\n\n<p>4) One person sits between N and P, who sits to the immediate left of Q.<br />\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/11/Antesh_snipped_D4.PNG\" style=\"width: 413px; height: 128px;\" /></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/11/Jay_D1.PNG\" style=\"width: 411px; height: 127px;\" /><br />\n5) R sits third to the right of P, who faces south.</p>\n\n<p>6) O sits to the immediate left of both L and J.</p>\n\n<p>7) M and R face the same direction.</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"//storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/20/11/Jay_D.PNG\" /></p>\nClearly, R sits immediate right of J.",
